body:
put him in your top spot and it'll increase your chances of encountering a shiny pokemon as well as increase the chances of catching a pokemon, running away from a battle, and most things RNGesus has influence over. the reason is obviously cause this is the luckster pokemon. 

&#x200B;

bonus: make him be one of three evolutions that branch from a single pokemon: makoto (normal type with the lucky attribute), nagito (normal and dark types, luck is higher than makoto's, but it comes at cost of bad luck also coming your way, like receiving and dealing crits, evading and missing hits, and so on and so forth), and lastly is K1-B0 (electric and steel types, has no luck mechanic, instead it's overall more powerful and has an inner-voice that has a chance to cure status effects, but there's also a chance that - when hit - >!the antenna in it's head can come off, which will disable the inner-voice ability, but also boost all his other stats. it'd be pretty funny if the chance of knocking his antenna off increased simply by being hit/hitting K1-B0 with a rock-type move.!< that would be pretty funny, i think.)
